From c880f94534d2feee157ab944879c7de74dcdfb7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 03:01:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] arm64: mediatek: add exact CPU9 P30E rearm

Validate the exact consumed CPU9 P30E publication and rebuild its
immutable request as a one-shot sequence-2 EMPTY target. Preserve
the target-side fail-closed claim and issue no CPU operation.
---
 arch/arm64/Kconfig                       |  22 +-
 arch/arm64/include/asm/mt6797_a72_p30e.h |   4 +
 arch/arm64/kernel/Makefile               |   1 +
 arch/arm64/kernel/mt6797_a72_p30e.c      | 112 +++++++++-
 arch/arm64/kernel/mt6797_a72_p30e_test.c | 261 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 392 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/kernel/mt6797_a72_p30e_test.c

